  t["Apareció porque…"] = "It appeared because…";
  t["Apenas distingue: la curva se pega a la diagonal, que es lo que haría contestando al azar."] = "It hardly distinguishes: the curve hugs the diagonal, which is what it would do answering at random.";
  t["Apenas por encima de la mitad: su capacidad de ordenar es prácticamente la del azar."] = "Barely above a half: its ability to rank is practically that of chance.";
  t["Apenas se solapan: el juez acierta casi siempre, y es fácil saber de qué lado está cada punto."] = "They barely overlap: the judge is almost always right, and it is easy to tell which side each point is on.";
