  t["Por $\\chi = 2 - 2g$, el género es $"] = "By $\\chi = 2 - 2g$, the genus is $";
  t["Por ALPES, $u = x$ (polinomio) y $dv = e^x dx$. Entonces $du = dx$ y $v = e^x$."] = "By LIATE, $u = x$ (algebraic) and $dv = e^x dx$. Then $du = dx$ and $v = e^x$.";
  t["Por ALPES, el polinomio va antes que el seno/coseno. Al derivarlo desaparece ($du = dx$) y la integral que queda, $\\int \\operatorname{sen} x\\,dx$, es inmediata."] = "By LIATE, the algebraic factor comes before the sine/cosine. Differentiating it makes it disappear ($du = dx$) and the integral left, $\\int \\sin x\\,dx$, is standard.";
  t["Por Sarrus sale $"] = "By Sarrus this gives $";
  t["Por cada dato: $2\\times"] = "For each datum: $2\\times";
