  t["Receta con parámetro: $\\det A = 0$ da los valores críticos; fuera de ellos, SCD; en cada uno, sustituir y calcular rangos."] = "Recipe with a parameter: $\\det A = 0$ gives the critical values; away from them, consistent and determinate; at each one, substitute and work out ranks.";
  t["Receta para estudiar una función"] = "Recipe for studying a function";
  t["Rechazarlo: el certificado es auténtico, pero no dice que esa clave sea de la web que se ha pedido"] = "Reject it: the certificate is genuine, but it does not say that that key belongs to the site that was requested";
  t["Reciben luz negativa, que se resta al ambiente: salen agujeros negros donde debería haber sombra"] = "They receive negative light, which is subtracted from the ambient: black holes appear where there should be shadow";
  t["Recolocar un centro"] = "Relocating a centre";
