  t["Recorta al final, al mostrar el color. Pero antes ese valor negativo se ha sumado al ambiente y lo ha comido: la sombra sale más oscura que el ambiente, y eso no ocurre en el mundo."] = "It clips at the end, when showing the colour. But before that the negative value has been added to the ambient and eaten it: the shadow comes out darker than the ambient, and that does not happen in the world.";
