  t["Relación lineal fuerte y regresión razonable"] = "Strong linear relation and reasonable regression";
  t["Relee la pregunta: ¿integral o área?"] = "Reread the question: integral or area?";
  t["Releer da sensación de dominio sin comprobarlo. Resolver ejercicios con «Otro» hasta que salgan a la primera es lo único que dice si lo sabes."] = "Rereading gives a feeling of mastery without checking it. Solving exercises with “Another” until they come out first time is the only thing that tells you whether you know it.";
  t["Releer en vez de resolver"] = "Rereading instead of solving";
  t["Releer produce la sensación de saber; solo resolver sin mirar la teoría la comprueba. Si un tema «se entiende» pero sus ejercicios fallan, no está aprendido."] = "Rereading produces the feeling of knowing; only solving without looking at the theory checks it. If a topic “is understood” but its exercises fail, it has not been learned.";
  t["Releer, dibujar y decir con tus palabras qué se pide cuesta un minuto y evita resolver otro problema distinto del que hay."] = "Re-reading, drawing and saying in your own words what is being asked costs a minute and stops you solving a different problem from the one in front of you.";
  t["Relieve"] = "Relief";
  t["Relieve de mentira"] = "Fake relief";
  t["Rellena las seis casillas."] = "Fill in the six boxes.";
  t["Rellena las tres componentes."] = "Fill in the three components.";
