  t["Secreto $s = 5$, umbral $k = 3$, módulo 17, con el polinomio $f(x) = 5 + 3x + 2x^2$. Calcular las partes 1, 2 y 3, y recuperar el secreto a partir de ellas con Lagrange."] = "Secret $s = 5$, threshold $k = 3$, modulo 17, with the polynomial $f(x) = 5 + 3x + 2x^2$. Compute shares 1, 2 and 3, and recover the secret from them with Lagrange.";
