  t["Semillas $A = (0, 0)$, $B = (2, 0)$ y $C = (0, 2)$. Para el píxel $(0{,}8,\\ 0{,}9)$, calcular $F_1$, $F_2$, la celda ganadora y la lectura $F_2 - F_1$. Repetir con la distancia Manhattan."] = "Seeds $A = (0, 0)$, $B = (2, 0)$ and $C = (0, 2)$. For the pixel $(0{.}8,\\ 0{.}9)$, compute $F_1$, $F_2$, the winning cell and the reading $F_2 - F_1$. Repeat with the Manhattan distance.";
  t["Semisuma y semidiferencia de 440 y 444: ¿cuánto valen?"] = "Half-sum and half-difference of 440 and 444: what are they?";
