  t["Un parámetro empieza en 0 y su primer gradiente vale $g = 5$. Con $\\eta = 0{,}1$, $\\beta_1 = 0{,}9$ y $\\beta_2 = 0{,}999$, calcular dónde queda. Repetir con $g = 500$."] = "A parameter starts at 0 and its first gradient is $g = 5$. With $\\eta = 0{.}1$, $\\beta_1 = 0{.}9$ and $\\beta_2 = 0{.}999$, compute where it ends up. Repeat with $g = 500$.";
